OL,3,GNEWSATwo more charged after car damaged
OL,4,Aby gunshots
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo more men have been charged after a
OL,7,Fcar was hit by gunshots in Swansea.
OL,9,FArmed officers from South Wales Police
OL,10,Fsaid a car on Clase Road, Morriston,
OL,11,Fsustained damage "consistent with a
OL,12,Ffirearms discharge" on Friday at 16:14
OL,13,FGMT.
OL,15,FOne person suffered minor injuries.
OL,17,FJames Gilheany, 49, from Llansamlet,
OL,18,Fhas been charged with possession of a
OL,19,Ffirearm with intent to cause fear of
OL,20,Fviolence and assault by beating.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
